    "generate-new-allowed": "Purely token-driven, no file. Generator may compose new instances (e.g. initials on an accent token). Must NOT carry an assetRef.",
    "user-supplied-only": "Generation-safe slot the user fills with their own file. assetRef, when present, must be `user-supplied:<name>`; never a source asset. Carries the role's refScheme."
